Eagle Board Scheduler
Copyright 2026 David Norman

This product includes software developed for a Scouting district board of
review check-in and room scheduler.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ORIGINAL WORK
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a reconstruction of a pre-existing application that was
received only as a compiled JAR (EagleBoardScheduler_20190618.jar). The Java
sources here were produced by decompiling that binary and then modernizing it;
they are a derivative of the original author's work.

See PROVENANCE.md for the reconstruction method and the checksum of the
original artifact.

